===Etymology===
From {{der|en|sn|dzimba-dze-mabwe|t=houses of stones}} (see {{m|sn|imba||house}}, {{m|sn|ibwe||stone}}), in reference to {{w|Great Zimbabwe}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/zɪmˈbɑːbweɪ/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Wodencafe-Zimbabwe.wav|Audio (US)}}
* {{hyphenation|en|Zim|ba|bwe}}
** {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-Zimbabwe.wav|Audio (Southern England)}}
{{rfap|en|variety=Zimbabwe|2=a Zimbabwe native speaking}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{senseid|en|Q954}}{{place|en|country|r/Southern Africa|official=Republic of Zimbabwe}}. Formerly called [[Southern Rhodesia]] or [[Rhodesia]].

